<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ to offer 2001, 2009 govt bonds in tender.</title>
<headline>RBNZ to offer 2001, 2009 govt bonds in tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday it would offer NZ$150 million of February 2001 government bonds at its next tender on July 10.</p>
<p>The bonds have an eight percent coupon.</p>
<p>The RBNZ will also offer $150 million July 2009 bonds, with a coupon of seven percent.</p>
<p>Bids close 11.30 a.m. (2330 GMT), results will be announced at 1 p.m. and settlement is July 15.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
